{"unit_id": "Jiaoyc224__dsh-plugin-dedupe#card-zh", "repo": "Jiaoyc224/dsh-plugin-dedupe", "commit": "558cbdfb3d787cf5ded06f49ae5de6dbd3474445", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-plugin-dedupe 是 DSH profile 的插件去重守护。它启动时读取 package.json 并扫描 node_modules，报告多来源重复依赖、重复安装和未声明的 DSH 插件；同协议的多字段声明会提示警告。它也可独立运行或接入 pnpm preinstall，发现冲突时返回非零状态。适合维护 DSH 插件依赖的用户。可用 DSH_PROFILE_DIR 指定 profile，并用 DSH_DEDUPE_WARN_ORPHANS 提示普通未声明依赖。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:97-198", "scripts/check-duplicates.mjs:89-211", "lib/index.js:24-41"]}
